	(text "SMD- ESD diodes,(24 is working voltage)\nattenuation /4- resistor divider(30k&10k),scales 0-5V down to 0-1.25V.\nRC filter- LPF cutoff 3.3kHz. cut inverter noise(10khz)\nclamp diodes- 2 in series, bottom one pretects against negative voltages, top one goes to\n2.8v clamp ref."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
