	(text "CAN termination (all 3 buses): 100 ohm + TLP176AM photorelay,\nswitched by the MCU: CAN1_TERM=PC0, CAN2_TERM=PC1, CAN3_TERM=PC3.\nEnable only where the VCU is an end of that bus. The relay isolates\nthe termination from MCU logic; firmware sets it, no jumpers."
